  "text": "Clean Energy Market Monitor – March 2024\n\nOverview\n\nAs clean energy deployment climbed new heights for some key technologies\n\nAnnual deployment of selected clean energy technologies, 2022 and 2023\n\nTechnology\tUnit\t2022\t2023\tGrowth\nSolar PV\tGW\t227\t420\t+85%\nWind\tGW\t75\t120\t+60%\nNuclear\tGW\t8\t5.6\t-30%\nElectric cars\tMillion\t10.4\t14\t+35%\nHeat pumps\tGW\t112\t109\t-3%\nElectrolysers\tMW\t130\t600\t+360%\n\nIEA 2024. CC BY 4.0.\n\nNote: \"Annual deployment\" refers to sales or capacity additions. GW = gigawatt; MW = megawatt; Mn = million.\n\nPAGE | 11\n\nIEA logo\n\nIEA. CC BY 4.0."
